sequenceDiagram
  participant C as client
  participant P as primary OSD
  participant S1 as secondary OSD 1
  participant S2 as secondary OSD 2
  C->>P: write(obj)
  par parallel replication
    P->>S1: replicate the write
    P->>S2: replicate the write
  end
  P->>P: commit in BlueStore
  S1-->>P: ack
  S2-->>P: ack
  P-->>C: ack (after all replicas commit)
